{"ID":"20240206110208-06uqb2u","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206110208-06uqb2u","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110208-06uqb2u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110216-gek83xo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110211-vxswsc5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110216-gek83xo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:210,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:210\u0026#125;","title":" 肿节风（草珊瑚、接骨木）","type":"doc","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206110216-gek83xo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110216-gek83xo","updated":"20240708164419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、广西、浙江、江西等地。\n【性状】\t本品长50-120cm。根茎较粗大，密生细根。茎圆柱形，多分枝，直径0.31.3cm；表面暗绿色至暗褐色，有明显细纵纹，散有纵向皮孔，节膨大；质脆，易折断，断面有髓或中空。叶对生，叶片卵状披针形至卵状椭圆形，长515cm，宽36cm；表面绿色、绿褐色至棕褐色或棕红色，光滑；边缘有粗锯齿，齿尖腺体黑褐色，叶柄长约 1cm；近革质。穗状花序顶生，常分枝。气微香，味微辛。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，平。\n【功效】\t抗菌消炎，祛风通络，活血散结。用于肺炎、阑尾炎、蜂窝组织炎、风湿痹痛、跌扑损伤、肿瘤。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110211-vxswsc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110211-vxswsc5","updated":"20240206110211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206110211-f12tfiy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708165229-63rofvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708165229-63rofvx","updated":"20240708165454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肿节风7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肿节风7-20240708165454-n1jf7up.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 315px;","style":"width: 305px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肿节风5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肿节风5-20240708165229-h5p1i5h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 305px;\" parent-style=\"width: 315px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708165355-enr0j6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708165355-enr0j6z","updated":"20240708165751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 595px;","style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肿节风4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肿节风4-20240708165047-5gf28l1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\" parent-style=\"width: 595px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 646px;","style":"width: 636px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240708165739-2ly4azy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 636px;\" parent-style=\"width: 646px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708164701-f1njq34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708164701-f1njq34","updated":"20240708165755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 582px;","style":"width: 572px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草珊瑚1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草珊瑚1-20240708164812-re12n4t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 572px;\" parent-style=\"width: 582px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 654px;","style":"width: 644px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肿节风2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肿节风2-20240708164945-w448tw4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 644px;\" parent-style=\"width: 654px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708164817-o6kfw7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708164817-o6kfw7k","updated":"20240708165801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 593px;","style":"width: 583px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240708165655-4n0rqs9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 583px;\" parent-style=\"width: 593px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 615px;","style":"width: 605px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草珊瑚2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草珊瑚2-20240708165332-vkua02z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 605px;\" parent-style=\"width: 615px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708165047-6wtnj58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708165047-6wtnj58","updated":"20240708170049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 747px;","style":"width: 737px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草珊瑚5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草珊瑚5-20240708170039-b8pc0yt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 737px;\" parent-style=\"width: 747px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 500px;","style":"width: 490px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草珊瑚4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草珊瑚4-20240708165924-2bpid4y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 490px;\" parent-style=\"width: 500px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830100826-8y75l6e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830100826-8y75l6e"}},{"ID":"20240830102127-kxa313v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-kxa313v","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：肿节风"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-ee4x342","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-ee4x342","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肿节风《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-dxl303u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-dxl303u","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhǒnɡJiéFēnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-dz72vlu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-dz72vlu","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】HERBASARCANDRAE"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-ecr9801","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-ecr9801","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】接骨金粟兰、九节茶、九节花、九节风、竹节茶、接骨莲"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-hrxcl7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-hrxcl7v","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为金粟兰科植物草珊瑚Sarcandraglabra（Thunb.）Nakai的干燥全株。夏、秋二季采收，除去杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-p0js92e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-p0js92e","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品长50～120cm。根茎较粗大，密生细根。茎圆柱形，多分枝,直径0.3～1.3cm；表面暗绿色至暗褐色，有明显细纵纹，散有纵向皮孔，节膨大；质脆，易折断，断面有髓或中空。叶对生，叶片卵状披针形至卵状椭圆形，长5～15cm，宽3～6cm；表面绿色、绿褐色至棕褐色或棕红色，光滑；边缘有粗锯齿，齿尖腺体黑褐色，叶柄长约1cm；近革质。穗状花序顶生，常分枝。气微香，味微辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-aw6s8e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-aw6s8e6","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-n9sww7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-n9sww7x","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品茎的横切面：表皮细胞类长方形或长圆形，外被角质层，外缘呈钝齿状。皮层细胞10余列，外侧为2～3列厚角细胞，内侧薄壁细胞内含棕黄色色素，石细胞单个或成群散在。中柱鞘纤维束呈新月形，断续环列，木化。韧皮部狭窄。形成层不明显。木质部管胞多数，射线宽2～8列细胞。髓部薄壁细胞较大，有时可见石细胞单个或成群散在。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-wwxn7bi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-wwxn7bi","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶的表面观：表皮细胞垂周壁波状弯曲或稍平直，气孔稍下陷，不定式。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-pu9jj7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-pu9jj7i","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末0.5g，置试管中，加锌粉少量与0.5％氯化铵溶液2滴，微火加热至干，在试管口上盖一小片用含5％对二甲氨基苯甲醛与20％三氯醋酸的苯溶液浸润过的滤纸，继续微火加热约1分钟，滤纸显粉红色至紫色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-1svvdm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-1svvdm1","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取本品粉末2g，加水50ml，超声处理30分钟，滤过，滤液加醋酸乙酯振摇提取2次，每次25ml，合并醋酸乙酯液，蒸干，残渣加甲醇1ml使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取肿节风对照药材2g，同法制成对照药材溶液。再取异秦皮啶对照品，加甲醇制成每1ml含0.5mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取上述三种溶液各4μl，分别点于同一以羧甲基纤维素钠为黏合剂的硅胶G薄层板上，以甲苯-醋酸乙酯-甲酸（9:4:1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，置紫外光灯（365nm）下检视。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材和对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的荧光斑点；置氨蒸气中熏10分钟，与对照品色谱相应的斑点变为黄绿色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-xzq12k5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-xzq12k5","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【含量测定】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-9mr6n0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-9mr6n0g","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"照高效液相色谱法（附录ⅥD）测定。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-xbi1tg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-xbi1tg0","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"色谱条件与系统适用性试验用十八烷基硅烷键合硅胶为填充剂；乙腈-0.1％磷酸溶液（20:80）为流动相；检测波长为344nm。理论板数按异秦皮啶峰计算应不低于1200。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-khecrn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-khecrn2","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对照品溶液的制备精密称取异秦皮啶对照品适量，加甲醇制成每1ml含4μg的溶液，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-b2subk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-b2subk2","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"供试品溶液的制备取本品粉末（过三号筛）0.4g[同时另取本品测定水分（附录ⅨH第一法）]，精密称定，置100ml量瓶中，加水90ml，静置过夜，超声处理（功率300W，频率25KHz）1.5小时，取出，放冷，用水稀释至刻度，摇匀，滤过，精密量取续滤液25ml，浓缩至近干，加水约5ml溶解并转移至分液漏斗中，用氯仿提取5次，每次10ml，合并氯仿液，蒸干，残渣加甲醇溶解并转移至10ml量瓶中，加甲醇至刻度，摇匀，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-omc2bg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-omc2bg1","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"测定法分别精密吸取对照品溶液与供试品溶液各20μl，注入液相色谱仪，测定，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-pjbvdwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-pjbvdwj","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品按干燥品计算，含异秦皮啶（C11H10O5）不得少于0.020％。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-u067q15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-u067q15","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去杂质，洗净，润透，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-wy2e6bh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-wy2e6bh","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦、辛、平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-kds80pp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-kds80pp","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归心、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-sgceny1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-sgceny1","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热凉血，活血消斑，祛风通络。用于血热紫斑、紫癜，风湿痹痛，跌打损伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-5vjncab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-5vjncab","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】9～30g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-vq2x7yc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-vq2x7yc","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-ps0zfzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-ps0zfzu","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-4ciekgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-4ciekgn","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肿节风《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-9o2ss5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-9o2ss5e","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhǒnɡJiéFēnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-cgz0yoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-cgz0yoe","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】GlabrousSarcandraHerb"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-2dm9b6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-2dm9b6e","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】九节茶、九节风、接骨莲"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-x1xqe19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-x1xqe19","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为金栗兰科植物草珊瑚Sarcandraglabra（Thunb.）Nakai的全株。夏、秋季采挖，除去杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-6zljddr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-6zljddr","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生常绿草本或亚灌木，高达2m。根茎粗大，支根多而细长。茎直立，多分支，节膨大。叶对生，近革质，长椭圆形或卵状披针形，长6～18cm，宽2～7cm，边缘有粗锯齿，齿尖具腺点；叶柄长约1cm，基部合生成鞘；托叶微小。穗状花序1～3个聚生茎顶；苞片卵状三角形；花小，无花被，黄绿色，芳香；雄蕊1，白色，棒状，花药2室；雌蕊球形，子房下位，柱头近头状。核果球形，鲜红色。花期6～7月，果期8～9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-9ckp0j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-9ckp0j6","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山沟、溪谷林阴湿地，分布于华东、中南、西南。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-nabopv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-nabopv2","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含挥发油、酯类、酚类、鞣质、黄酮、氰甙、香豆素、内酯。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-r78ktmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-r78ktmm","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】性微温，味苦、辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-6wjyrsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-6wjyrsc","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】抗菌消炎，祛风通络，活血散结。用于肺炎、阑尾炎、蜂窝组织炎、风湿痹痛、跌扑损伤、肿瘤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-bhiv4ku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-bhiv4ku","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-2z9uoda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-2z9uoda","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肿节风《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-v3t6054","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-v3t6054","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhǒnɡJiéFēnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-p76kdyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-p76kdyq","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】观音茶、接骨木、九节风、驳节茶、鸭脚节、山牛膝、珍珠兰、九节草、野靛、九节茶、学士茶、接骨丹、接骨草、接骨金粟兰、铜脚灵仙、九节兰、节骨茶、接骨莲、竹茶。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-de5a4mo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-de5a4mo","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-mzslqli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-mzslqli","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为金粟兰科植物草珊瑚的全株或根。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-mc1fvyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-mc1fvyn","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Sarcandraglabra(Thunb.)Makai［Chloranthusglaber(Thunb.)Makino］"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-e3p5fh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-e3p5fh3","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可采收，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-r90drhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-r90drhl","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】草珊瑚常绿半灌木，高50-150cm。茎数枝丛生，绿色，节部明显膨大。叶对生；叶柄长0.5-1.5cm，基部合生成鞘状；托叶钻形；叶片草质，椭圆形、卵形至卵状披外形，长6-17cm，宽2-6cm，先端渐尖，基部楔形，边缘具粗锐锯齿，齿尖有一腺体，两面无毛。穗状花序顶生，分枝，连总花便长1.5-4cm；苞片三角形；花黄绿色；雄蕊1，肉质，棒状至圆柱状，花药2室，生于药隔上部之两侧，侧向或有时内向；雌蕊1，由1心皮组成；子房球形或卵形，无花柱，柱头近头状。核果球形，直径3-4mm，熟时亮红色。花期6-7月，果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-co8sgl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-co8sgl5","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-t9wm5st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-t9wm5st","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于山谷林下阴湿处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-9jz24rg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-9jz24rg","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于安徽、浙江、江西、福建、台湾、湖南、广东、广西、四川、贵州和云南。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-6v406ac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-6v406ac","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-6vihefo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-6vihefo","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别全株长40-150cm。主根粗短，直径l-2cm，支根甚多，长而坚韧。茎圆柱形，直径约0.5cm，多分枝，节部膨大；表面深绿色或棕褐色，具细纵皱纹，粗茎有稀疏分布的皮孔；质脆，易折断，断面谈棕色，边缘纤维状，中央具棕色疏松的髓或中空。叶对生，叶柄长0.5-1cm，软硬，基部合生抱茎；叶片薄革质，卵状披针形或长椭圆形，表面光滑，上面棕色或灰绿色，下面色较淡，边缘具粗锯齿，齿尖有黑褐色腺体，叶脉在两面均隆起。枝端常有棕色的穗状花序，多分校。气微香，味微辛。以茎、叶色绿者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-kyjfbns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-kyjfbns","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别茎横切面：表皮细胞1列，外被角质层。皮层外侧有2-3列厚角细胞，内侧为7-10列薄壁细胞，有少数油细胞和含鞣质细胞散在；石细胞单个或成群，多边形至类圆形，纹孔明显。韧皮部外侧纤维束呈新月形，壁厚，木化，每束纤维两侧常有1-4个切向延长的大形厚壁细胞；韧皮部狭窄；形成层不明显；木质部多为管胞，径向排列。初生射线宽4-5列细胞，次生射线宽1-2列细胞。髓大，有少数鞣质细胞散在，有时可见大形石细胞单个或成群存在；老茎髓部中心常中空。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-sxhj3kk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-sxhj3kk","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶横切面：表皮外被厚用质层，下表皮可见气孔。栅栏组织细胞1列，细胞短小，不通过主脉；海绵组织有少数油细胞散在。主脉向上方略隆起，向下方突出，上下表皮内侧有l-2列厚角细胞；维管束1-2个，外韧型，其内、外侧均有发达的纤维群，纤维壁厚，木化；石细胞不规则多角形，单个或成群分布于薄壁组织中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-wolyg5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-wolyg5b","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】全株含左旋类没药素甲（istanbulinA），异秦皮定（isofraxiden），延胡索酸（fumaricacid）琥珀酸（succinicacid），黄酮甙及香豆精衍生物事。此外，还含0.15％-0.20％的挥发油。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-6oy71og","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-6oy71og","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别（1）取本品粉末0.5g，置试管中，加锌粉少许和0.5％氯化铵溶液2滴，微火加热至干，在试管口盖以一小片在5％对二甲氨基本甲醛和20％三氯乙酸苯溶液中浸润过的滤纸，继续微火加热约lmin，滤纸显粉红色至紫色圆斑。（检查琥珀酸及延胡索酸）（2）取本品粉末少许，加乙醇0.5ml，置水浴中微热，取滤液点于滤纸上，干燥后在紫外光灯下观察，显亮蓝色荧光，氨熏后，显黄色荧光。（检查黄酮类）"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-c9qaf6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-c9qaf6x","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去杂质，洗净，润透，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-8m0ye5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-8m0ye5o","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦；辛；平"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-w7fkxm0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-w7fkxm0","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归心、肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-qjv05mh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-qjv05mh","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风除湿；活血散瘀；清热解毒。主肢体麻木；跌打损伤；骨折；妇女痛经；产后瘀滞腹痛；肺炎；争性阑尾炎；急性胃肠炎；菌痢；胆囊炎；脓肿；口腔炎；风湿痹痛"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-q68t26l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-q68t26l","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，9-15g；或浸酒。外用：适量，捣敷；研末调敷；或煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-t4u53e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-t4u53e2","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制剂】肿节风片、肿节风注射液、血康口服液。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102127-e3w8t7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102127-e3w8t7z","updated":"20240830102137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102129-hqg3c6s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830102129-hqg3c6s","updated":"20240830102137"}},{"ID":"20240830102130-oeu6wys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102130-oeu6wys","updated":"20240830102137"}}]}